The Qwen integration has been adapted for explicit base/adapter loading,
public manifest inputs, differentiable encoding, and fail-fast preprocessing.
The IQD analysis and RAD training components accompany the paper
"From Intrinsic Quantization Difficulty to Ranking-Aware Distillation for
Low-Bit Multimodal Retrieval" by Leiyue Chen and Hao Chen.
